@page "/privacy"
@inject BusinessInfoService InfoService

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - Oxyniti</PageTitle>

<h2 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h2>

<div class="content-section">
    <p class="text-muted">
        <em>Draft placeholder &mdash; pending final legal review and sign-off by @InfoService.ApplicationName before this page is treated as binding.</em>
    </p>

    <h5>Information we collect</h5>
    <p>
        We collect information you provide directly (such as name, email, shipping
        address, and phone number during checkout or account registration) and
        basic usage data needed to operate the site (such as cart contents and
        order history).
    </p>

    <h5>How we use it</h5>
    <p>
        We use your information to process orders, manage your account, respond
        to enquiries submitted through the Contact and Quote forms, and improve
        the site. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
    </p>

    <h5>Payment information</h5>
    <p>
        Payments are processed by Stripe. We do not store your full card details
        on our servers.
    </p>

    <h5>Your choices</h5>
    <p>
        You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal
        data by contacting us through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
</div>
